*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FRD0024
*> PURPOSE : FRAUD SCORING RULES
*> AUTHOR  : R.T.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-02-14 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2003-11-04 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 432
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FRDNIGHT STEP080
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FRD0024.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    COPY FRD0024C.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 TXN-HOLD-IND       PIC X VALUE 'N'.
    05 RVW-IND            PIC X VALUE 'N'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM 4000-CHANNEL-RULES
    DISPLAY "TXN-HOLD-IND=" TXN-HOLD-IND
    DISPLAY "RVW-IND=" RVW-IND
    STOP RUN.
4000-CHANNEL-RULES.
    IF CHNL-CD = 'O'
        *> CARD-NOT-PRESENT ONLINE PURCHASE
        IF CARD-PRESENT = 'N' AND TRAN-AMT > 1000
            MOVE 'Y' TO TXN-HOLD-IND
            MOVE 'Y' TO RVW-IND
        ELSE IF TRAN-AMT > 7500.00
            MOVE 'Y' TO RVW-IND
        END-IF
        END-IF
    ELSE
        MOVE 'N' TO TXN-HOLD-IND
    END-IF.
